msgstr "የተቀመጠው ቁልፍ የሚያልቀው በ…%s — ለመተካት አዲስ ይለጥፉ"

#: includes/ai-core/class-admin.php:230
msgid "Key (optional)"
msgstr "ቁልፍ (አማራጭ)"

#: includes/ai-core/class-admin.php:230
